The geometry was generated for Qimgui from the unmodified MaterialShapes class
body using AndroidX graphics-shapes-desktop 1.1.0. The exporter supplies minimal
Compose Offset and 2D Matrix adapters derived from the pinned AndroidX sources.
The native C++ renderer and exporter integration are Qimgui additions.

Exact source URLs, commit and SHA-256 digests are in provenance.json.
Reproduction dependency URLs and SHA-256 digests are in
../../scripts/material_shapes/dependencies.lock.json. Those JVM dependencies
are development tools only and are not shipped in the native application.
